TEXT 0 416 Left 2 ;Half-wave rectifier with a 100 uF reservoir: D1 conducts in short peaks. RMS and average of
TEXT 0 440 Left 2 ;V(out) are nearly equal (little ripple), but the diode current's RMS is several times its
TEXT 0 464 Left 2 ;average. Right-click D1 > Plot power P(D1) and set cursors A and B one period (20 ms) apart:
TEXT 0 488 Left 2 ;the readout's average is the diode's loss, as .meas pd says.
